---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Three stages of the program in the post (fake driver, SetMaxOpenConns(2)).
const panels = [
  { x: 20, en: '1. After sql.Open', vi: '1. Sau sql.Open', icons: [null, null], opened: '0',
    s1_en: 'not opened', s1_vi: 'chưa mở', s2_en: 'not opened', s2_vi: 'chưa mở', held: [false, false] },
  { x: 315, en: '2. After PingContext', vi: '2. Sau PingContext', opened: '1', icons: ['db', null],
    s1_en: 'open, idle', s1_vi: 'mở, đang rảnh', s2_en: 'not opened', s2_vi: 'chưa mở', held: [false, false], open: [true, false] },
  { x: 610, en: '3. Two held, a third waits', vi: '3. Hai đang giữ, người thứ ba chờ', opened: '2', icons: ['lock', 'lock'],
    s1_en: 'held by c1', s1_vi: 'c1 đang giữ', s2_en: 'held by c2', s2_vi: 'c2 đang giữ', held: [true, true], open: [true, true] },
];
---
<figure class="gp14e">
  <div class="gp14e-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 284" role="img" aria-label="A database/sql pool with a maximum of two connections in three stages. After sql.Open no connection exists. After PingContext one is open. When two callers hold both, a third caller waits and times out.">
    {panels.map((p) => (
      <g>
        <text x={p.x} y="24" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>{p.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{p.vi}</tspan></text>
        <rect x={p.x} y="40" width="270" height="92" rx="6" class="box" />
        <rect x={p.x + 10} y="52" width="120" height="68" rx="5" class={p.open && p.open[0] ? 'box' : 'own'} style={p.open && p.open[0] ? 'fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text)' : ''} />
        <rect x={p.x + 140} y="52" width="120" height="68" rx="5" class={p.open && p.open[1] ? 'box' : 'own'} style={p.open && p.open[1] ? 'fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text)' : ''} />
        {p.icons[0] && <DiagramIcon name={p.icons[0]} x={p.x + 70} y={71} size={26} />}
        <text x={p.x + 70} y="106" text-anchor="middle" class={p.open && p.open[0] ? '' : 'm'}><tspan data-lang-en>{p.s1_en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{p.s1_vi}</tspan></text>
        {p.icons[1] && <DiagramIcon name={p.icons[1]} x={p.x + 200} y={71} size={26} />}
        <text x={p.x + 200} y="106" text-anchor="middle" class={p.open && p.open[1] ? '' : 'm'}><tspan data-lang-en>{p.s2_en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{p.s2_vi}</tspan></text>
        <text x={p.x} y="156" class="m num"><tspan data-lang-en>connections opened: {p.opened}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>số connection đã mở: {p.opened}</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <rect x="610" y="176" width="270" height="76" rx="6" class="bad fm-pulse" />
    <DiagramIcon name="hourglass" x={638} y={214} size={30} />
    <text x="668" y="202" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>third caller waits</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>người gọi thứ ba chờ</tspan></text>
    <text x="668" y="224"><tspan data-lang-en>200 ms later: context</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>200 ms sau: context</tspan></text>
    <text x="668" y="242">deadline exceeded</text>
    <text x="20" y="208" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>The pool opens connections only when a caller asks, up to SetMaxOpenConns.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Pool chỉ mở connection khi có người cần, tối đa SetMaxOpenConns.</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="232" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>A connection that is never handed back stays held for ever.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Connection không bao giờ được trả lại thì bị giữ mãi.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Counts come from the real run in this section. An unclosed <code>sql.Rows</code> holds a connection the same way the unreleased <code>c1</code> and <code>c2</code> do.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Các số lấy từ lần chạy thật trong mục này. <code>sql.Rows</code> không đóng giữ connection y như <code>c1</code> và <code>c2</code> chưa trả lại.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp14e { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp14e-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp14e svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp14e text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp14e .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp14e .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp14e .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp14e .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp14e .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp14e .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp14e .own { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp14e .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp14e .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp14e .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp14e .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp14e figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
